        <p id="section-9-2"><strong>9.2 Zero tolerance.</strong> We have zero tolerance for objectionable content and abusive users. You may not post or send content that is hateful, harassing, threatening, sexually explicit, or discriminatory, or that targets another person, and you may not use chat, direct messages, league names, team names, avatars, or any other feature to abuse other people.</p>
